            "review_text": "Thomaster\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam112 contributions\n0\nThe Best Omakase in Saigon\nSep 2022 • Friends\nDefinitely the best Omakase in Saigon. They have some signature dishes with many twists that other traditional Omakase restaurants do not have.\nYou must go for the premium set, super worthy rather than the basic set.\nThey have 2 slots to serve you at Omakase counter, cannot just walk in spontaneously\nHighly recommend for all Japanese cuisine lovers\nRead more\nWritten October 3, 2022\nRoka Fella\nDear ThomasDoan,\n\nThank you for dining at Roka Fella and sharing your experience with us on TripAdvisor.\n\nWe are happy to learn that you had a pleasant dining experience and enjoyed our delightful contemporary Omakase culinary. At Roka Fella, we always wish to create an outstanding dining experience and your compliments are highly appreciated as a huge motivation for our team to continuously thrive for the best quality of service.\n\nOnce again, thank you for choosing us and we look forward to welcoming you back in the upcoming future.\n\nWarmest regards,\n\nThanh Nguyen\n\nMarketing Executive\nRead more\nWritten October 19, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
